{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EXO","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"出埃及記","commonName":"出埃及記","title":"出埃及記","order":2,"numberOfChapters":40,"sha256":"61798aad81a685f9835bfe998aedebfde8d4930c7a46a050008db0e45788c359","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EXO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":40,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EXO/40.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1208},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["摩西頌讚耶和華"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那時，摩西和以色列人便歌頌耶和華，說：",{"text":"「我要歌頌耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因祂大獲全勝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂把戰馬和騎兵都拋進海中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華是我的力量，我的詩歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也成了我的拯救；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂是我的上帝，我要讚美祂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂是我父親的上帝，我要尊崇祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華是戰士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂名叫耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂把法老的戰車軍兵都拋進海中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"法老的強將都葬身於紅海，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大水淹沒他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們如同石塊沉入深海。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你的右手用大能彰顯威榮；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你的右手擊碎仇敵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你大顯威嚴，擊倒那些起來對抗你的人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你大發雷霆，他們便像枯草遇火，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一燒而盡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的鼻孔一呼氣，海水便堆聚起來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"洪濤便堆起水牆，海底深處也都凝固。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敵人說，『追啊，追上他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瓜分他們的財物，盡情擄掠他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拔出刀來把他們斬盡殺絕。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你叫風一吹，海水就淹沒他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們好像鉛塊一樣沉沒在怒海中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，萬神之中，誰能像你？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能像你——威嚴神聖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可頌可畏，廣行神蹟？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你伸出右手，大地便吞滅他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你以不變的愛引領你所救贖的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以大能帶他們進入你的聖所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各邦聽見這些事就發抖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"非利士人痛苦不堪，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以東的族長惶恐不安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押的英雄瑟瑟發抖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦南的居民膽戰心驚。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"驚駭恐懼籠罩著他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你臂膀的大能嚇得他們僵立如石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到你的子民都安然走過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到你買贖的子民都安然走過。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要帶領他們到你產業的山上安居，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到你為自己所造的住處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，到你親手建的聖所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"「耶和華必做王，直到永永遠遠。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["法老的軍兵車馬追到海中，耶和華使海水回流淹沒他們，以色列人卻踏著乾地走在海中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["亞倫的姐姐米利暗先知手拿小鼓，帶領眾婦女擊鼓跳舞，"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["唱和道：「要歌頌耶和華，因祂大獲全勝，祂把戰馬和騎兵都拋進海中。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["苦水"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["摩西帶領以色列人離開紅海，來到書珥曠野，走了三天仍然找不到水喝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["到了瑪拉，那裡的水卻是苦的，不能喝。因此那地方叫瑪拉",{"noteId":5},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["百姓就埋怨摩西說：「我們喝什麼呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["摩西向耶和華呼求，耶和華就指示他一棵樹，他把樹扔在水中，水就變甘甜了。耶和華又在瑪拉給百姓定下律例和法令，並在那裡試驗他們，"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["說：「你們若留心聽你們上帝耶和華的話，做我視為正的事，聽從我的命令，遵守我的一切律例，我就不把降在埃及的疾病加在你們身上，因為我是醫治你們的耶和華。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["到了以琳，那裡有十二股水泉和七十棵棕樹，他們就在水邊安營。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"「瑪拉」意思是「苦」。","reference":{"chapter":15,"verse":23}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EXO/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EXO/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EXO/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":27}